    "answer": {
      "short": "Blanks in order: $180$; $50$; vertically; straight; $50$; $50$; vertically; opposite.",
      "worked": "$$a+130^\\circ=180^\\circ$$\nAngles on a straight line.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}a&=180^\\circ-130^\\circ\\\\a&=50^\\circ\\end{align*}$$\n\n$b=130^\\circ$ (vertically opposite angles).\n\n$c+130^\\circ=180^\\circ$ (straight angle).\n\n$$\\begin{align*}c&=180^\\circ-130^\\circ\\\\c&=50^\\circ\\end{align*}$$\n\n$c=a=50^\\circ$ (vertically opposite angles), agreeing with the straight-angle calculation.",
